      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I came here specifically to make this point, it is absurd that a free to play game needs to make you pay for something that simply just makes it possible for adults to play this game without being harrassed by children.\n\nNot only that but so many peoples experiences get ruined because they either can't afford to make the purchase or any other reason, which gets people left behind or left out.\n\nPlease make age verifacation free at minimum, I promise it would make this game so much better and less likley to cause separation.\n\n-Senko\n\nThank you for reading.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
